<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰνοπλ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suit of armour of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλίτης</span>, i.e. shield, helmet,
			breast plate, greaves, sword, and lance, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.45.11
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				16.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				421.39
			</span></i> (Thermae, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκα σκευάσαντες πανοπλίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανοπλίᾳ παντελεῖ κοσμηθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					796c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοσμήσαντες π. Ἑλληνικῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.180
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανοπλίαν ἕστηκ᾽ ἔχουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					830
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔχων βαδίζεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					951
				</span></i>
			: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐπάργυροι καὶ κατάχρυσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					1.20
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδύσασθε τὴν π. τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					6.11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
